+
+## Embedded task manager
+
+The root-scoped `schedule.manager` factory reuses the Tasks page, rule editor, and saved delivery history. Its caller supplies `onNewTask` and `onOpenSession`, the standard Session and Workspace sources, and a Remote service scoped to the authorized catalog. The factory does not activate Sessions or create reminders. Existing workspace and Sidebar entries activate only when their navigation dependencies are present.
